{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "34421e5ee80a39597cfde5a2df5a2897e230df4e3179d585edbaf75f5f03e93a", "ja": "今、立っている場所", "zh": "现在立足之所", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "caf9dbc27ce3b5362b26401ef04387896225de42617e1b428b689422d8af907d", "ja": "公演当日、開演前のアナウンスを担当する事\nになった5人。ちょっとしたミスも余裕で\n乗り越え、会場はいい雰囲気。開演が近づく\n中、静香はインタビューの続きをさせて欲し\nいと言い、自分だけの答えを語るのだった。", "zh": "公演当天，负责开演前广播的5人。她们轻松克服了些许失误，现场气氛也变得很好。随着开演时间临近，静香表示希望继续进行采访，并说出了只属于自己的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51c59fcbec0c1032b84f548c1c959c9898e79eea0132335db5c9b57d32e4ea66", "ja": "（その後、撮影スケジュールの都合もあり、\n静香のインタビューは公演後、改めてになった）", "zh": "（之后，因为拍摄日程的关系，静香的采访只好改到公演结束后再进行了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ff248d6dcd4318822633f9fd9d41a515d66ebacf96e8b0e1997e14539bb5552c", "ja": "（そして、公演当日……）", "zh": "（然后，到了公演当天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "e739810278e0273ea7735ccc4e7ab2e6112e3c75bda7912408f2a0bbb3e8ee9b", "ja": "こんにちは！　本日は765プロライブ劇場に\nお越しいただき、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "大家好！感谢各位今天来到765Pro Live剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "c5b2e63a8a411eb123597e0c7799079b1f9ad64d001d4169dd5d2ed9450a0253", "ja": "ここからは私、天海春香と……", "zh": "接下来由我，天海春香，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "78675920d729c581dbbcd664dac7b214d6bbfccecd716e456f4d2a47fb9a3466", "ja": "最上静香が、開演前のアナウンスを担当します！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "最上静香，负责演出开始前的广播！\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "be62147da9dfa1a7ce3d45e8941cef744cc99d242c54a93fa18bead8051a70ba", "ja": "ワァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "df0b5ebc97914d020ba8e4efac328fbf8a1d66ad92a1ef84911964e73150d1f7", "ja": "えへへ♪　ちょっとだけ早く、\nみなさんにお会いできて、嬉しいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪能稍微提前一点见到大家，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "d13e8401d88076be406894522f96d7f88b75f8f02d2dd694b6e2e7090d167599", "ja": "まずは、開演前の諸注意です。\n……。", "zh": "首先是开演前的注意事项。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "c1884c805a40d92df5bb48ead46ed7e21f7691f429507bebb93cfbc258aeac1a", "ja": "……以上となります。まもなく開演ですので、\nロビーにおいでの方は、お席にてお待ちください。", "zh": "……以上。演出即将开始，\n请在大厅的各位回到座位等候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "36d18ce15a9048d4b254541f21f9300d6fb83f2e0aa95a4b2f91f4ea5d551860", "ja": "ふぅ……っと。\nお疲れさま、静香ちゃん！", "zh": "呼……好了。\n辛苦了，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "e95154567a53b093cd746803b21787c3b80b89f566576e98305f7ca804f078ff", "ja": "お疲れさまです。……はぁ、緊張しました。\n噛まないようにって、そればかり意識してて……。", "zh": "辛苦了。……唉，刚才真是紧张。\n一直只顾着提醒自己别咬字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "d14a3f1875a051807385835f4458d5a08cf394dae584f3630834ad14319f8f9c", "ja": "あはは、でも、バッチリだったよ♪\nそれじゃ、私たちもスタンバイして……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，不过，发挥得很完美哦♪\n那我们也准备待命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "9405b0220e2d6cdf702ecaad848cb19dfe16079d5329e1614838face7cab3dc9", "ja": "は、春香さん！　静香ちゃん！\nマイク、マイク！　オンになったままです……！", "zh": "春、春香小姐！静香小姐！\n麦克风，麦克风！还开着呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "d12fc7f999bd15e49ef33eb64f07931f64d48214d87eb9470bb8246938bc4f6d", "ja": "えっ？　……ああっ！？", "zh": "咦？……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "df8b5f42274e153c784f4136054823ed67498b4781dab34485cba6e570e3206d", "ja": "あははははははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "36cbc8c99132fa4ebb39a4c3c53a00f6390225e20b79b38b228cb9bba6e5fe2b", "ja": "こんにちは、天空橋朋花です～。\n子豚ちゃんたち、いい子にしていましたか～？", "zh": "你们好，我是天空桥朋花～  \n小猪崽们，有乖乖听话吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "e735939c5692b96fe9eb2bab558de29661cb05d2e3aaa65e15bbc65039133ea1", "ja": "わたし達も、我慢できなくて来ちゃいました♪\nみなさん、今日は来てくれてありがとうございます！", "zh": "我们也忍不住跑过来了♪\n大家，今天非常感谢你们的光临！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "59fd128e60288ac8df6bbcef9a83746d2831e9a17bceac58bb8b82b6dc585014", "ja": "とってもいい風が吹いていますね！\n今日は最後まで、ぜひお楽しみくださいっ！", "zh": "今天的风真舒服呢！\n还请大家一定欣赏到最后哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "62153eaa2ad791ca379fd4d85879a3bf03f206f76e8feac511c6645ce2684c04", "ja": "春香さん、静香ちゃんからも、\n最後に何かありますか～？", "zh": "春香、静香，\n你们最后还有什么想说的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "829b84291804215f37c04e8b0d5382c566f1ea5222f0e7f1ca27f9a07d71cfa5", "ja": "ええと……後はとにかく、本番を見て頂きたいです！\n絶対に損はさせませんから。", "zh": "那个……总之，希望大家一定要看看正式演出！\n绝对不会让大家失望的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "0c44295b380e6984dc94ee997a90b068d218085b7a8812c821b13b6f3cf2da7a", "ja": "うう、フォローありがとう、みんな……\nというわけで、開演までもう少しお待ちくださいっ！", "zh": "呜呜，谢谢大家帮我解围……\n那么，请再稍等一会儿，演出马上就要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1021_audience", "source_sha256": "ad0fc7fbe8e1b206637b7602dd570916e8968406a1ec0058e316e4dde065ab72", "ja": "パチパチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪啪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "a52e39a195929d69be7b11c991a5178a4dc611b5a81ff78084c8b92ef70308e8", "ja": "うう、やっちゃった……。恥ずかしい……！", "zh": "呜呜，搞砸了……好丢脸……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "471510c0c112cdf1b786df43bbda0bb87145e82937bef82ade9d24b5fbfbb5a6", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。ちょっとしたミスはあったけど、\n問題なしだな！　ウケてたし。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。虽说出了点小失误，\n不过完全没问题！观众反响也挺热烈的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "cf0bb8db95e0623b72ac56265c1464064f18790a34929c7b9d86a9d61e53408f", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？　他人事みたいに\n言いますけど、フォローは本来、そちらの役目では～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？　虽然您说得像事不关己一样，\n但打圆场本来应该是您的职责吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b5f86946306c0f893ab243ccd49136329d44736cb28446c48a6e5c2f7a0173e2", "ja": "い、いや、これくらいなら、任せても\n平気だろうと思って……信頼してるから！", "zh": "不、不是啦，我是觉得这点小事交给你\n也不会有问题的……因为我很信任你啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "ee2f22de1a5dee53c6d9172644392e254c88ba283ed785284e60bca7296e4f1f", "ja": "あはは……みんな、ゴメンね。\nおかげで、なんとかまとまったよ……ふぅ。", "zh": "啊哈哈……大家，对不起哦。\n多亏了你们，总算梳理好了……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "3864262281230db72f2fb40dcaa4029741509cbd01c6f875ab82d50e07579adb", "ja": "気にしないでください！　わたし達も\nアナウンスができて、よかったです！　えへへ。", "zh": "请不要在意！我们也能帮忙进行通知，真是太好了！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "f1205b3cb697ac2af42afbd119d62c583c0623d711b258ec7245de0f69391977", "ja": "そうそう！\nお互いさまですよ、お互いさま♪　なんて。", "zh": "对对！  \n彼此彼此嘛♪　嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1029_staff", "source_sha256": "7553848a711a02567c7ef00569470e3e5cd1b2a926ed7c4a050c47a51197db66", "ja": "ふぅ……いよいよ、ですね。密着取材させてもらった\nせいか、こっちまで緊張してきましたよ……。", "zh": "呼……终于要开始了呢。也许是因为一直在旁边进行贴身采访，我这边也跟着紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "4b56af57499d85833f9aa3942ca2c5dc8bf9746b22b1173cafe32ada34abd7e4", "ja": "あはは……。\nあ、そうだ。あの、スタッフさん。今いいですか？", "zh": "啊哈哈……\n啊，对了。那个，工作人​​员，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "c26d4432c601078f98168702643ce24039467ca80c6431c3afcff2cda47b4c87", "ja": "私のインタビューの続き、させてもらいたくて。", "zh": "我想继续接受采访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1032_staff", "source_sha256": "f816aaaa5b8d24921b01240cbaf0303bb5c11ebbf2eac40ea625de83c5807466", "ja": "えっ、今からですか？\nそれはもちろん、こちらは構いませんが……。", "zh": "咦，现在就开始吗？\n当然可以，我这边没问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "38afe6dff1ac43e2fded43411aefb670aaceb1c54c222c93ea1c080d3d8aa238", "ja": "公演の前に、今の気持ちを言葉にしておきたいので。\n{$P$}、いいですか？", "zh": "演出开始前，我想把现在的心情用语言记录下来。\n{$P$}，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "1d7f38132d4ec755b0a2d39391cc6e2afbe0d8f4a61446dc0fbdb02cc86d1ad4", "ja": "もちろん、静香さえいいなら構わないよ。\n撮影、お願いできますか？", "zh": "当然，只要静香觉得可以就没问题。\n拍摄的事，能麻烦您吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1035_staff", "source_sha256": "e4ad6b82dd735f686638ac5e679c7ce6ae9d760de7a9bccd1f467e47caca990d", "ja": "わかりました、それじゃ……", "zh": "知道了，那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "fe487e25dbbc902324e7b7e0fde699c8c7fb827c7eeee7d5eaa689fb92a83366", "ja": "ええと……こほん。アイドルになることは、\n私の、小さい頃からの夢でした。", "zh": "那个……咳咳。成为偶像，是我从小以来的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "50a6f86d304b7e6695d08b31bcfb001f0d6c86343744976deed46484b9320dd9", "ja": "いつか絶対、あのステージに立つんだって……\nだからその夢が叶った時は、本当に嬉しくて。", "zh": "总有一天我一定要站上那个舞台……\n所以当那个梦想实现的时候，我真的非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1039_staff", "source_sha256": "b63c932b573600b86ddc55be08e1b6b1f83ee83025e45560992077c4d4fdb3a3", "ja": "お気持ち、わかる気がします。\n夢が叶って……それで、燃え尽きてしまった？", "zh": "我好像能理解您的心情。\n梦想实现了……然后，就燃尽了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "7826d4456bf764a9d37c9f99737b9a0fb3cf66bc60bd1679a59e1d6cbc265bd3", "ja": "いいえ！\n全然、そんなことなかったです。", "zh": "没有！\n完全没有这回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "ee3e4c62f1c9a0e51d9d35ed552152f424431a87de3e9f98de1f7c4f6ca0f01d", "ja": "ひとつの夢が叶ったら、また新しい夢ができる……\n今の私も、そうなんです。", "zh": "实现了一个梦想后，还会有新的梦想诞生……\n现在的我，也是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "a6776e09610f050c7526f34860c61f2376917a3536b560aeb7e75e4c6e930813", "ja": "トップアイドルという、大きな夢……。\n正直、くじけそうになることだって、ありますけど。", "zh": "成为顶级偶像这个远大的梦想……说实话，也有过差点坚持不下去的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "54f5edd11c9875830307953c8f882903daa30570fe4f6cca2243acbbcad9b13d", "ja": "静香ちゃん……。", "zh": "静香……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ab04689bb31a5fd6df28a1a1b504dc0cfb68b0db5431b9e2aff247660cf0fc9", "ja": "でも……これだけは言いたいです。\nアイドルは……とっても、楽しいですよ！", "zh": "但是……唯独这件事，我想告诉您。\n成为偶像……真的非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac2c41ca7fd349a021328d156f9d17d7cbe2f92f905d903a050fac4486b0e522", "ja": "大変なことも多いけど、アイドルになるっていう\n夢を叶えた今が、一番充実しています！", "zh": "虽然辛苦的事情很多，但实现了成为偶像这个\n梦想的现在，是最充实的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "244c46c575ffe2559d8965428c3a8e0819f9303c6c968b57f0611d299cfdd355", "ja": "今日は、そんな気持ちをステージに持って行きますね。\n夢の先を歩いている、私の姿……見ていてください！", "zh": "今天，我也会把这样的心情带到舞台上。\n请看着走在梦想尽头的我……♀♀♀♀♀♀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0286_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_06_1048_p", "source_sha256": "90f463178b85eca729d32f06a936d9ce04e40c2fb8a0fb3948ffb1bd9f7fc604", "ja": "（うん……いいインタビューになったな。\n静香、お疲れさま！）", "zh": "（嗯……这次采访进行得很顺利。静香，辛苦了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
